NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000213 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000214 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000215 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000216 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000217 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000218 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000219 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000220 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000221 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000222 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000223 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000224 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000225 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000226 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000227 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000228 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000229 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000230 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000231 ""
